        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-tk-ink-2">
          Every week, updates to outside software components are
          proposed automatically across everything we ship — the
          server, the web apps, the SDKs, and the desktop app. Nothing
          is accepted unless the full automated test suite passes; only
          small bug-fix updates go in automatically, and anything
          bigger waits for human review.
        </p>
